  "vulnerability_information": "Hello nextcloud, i have another findings, i found that email address enumeration and or username enumeration is possible in signup/registration and forgot password under https://help.nextcloud.com/ , email/username enumeration can be use in any malicious intent by a malicious minded user.\n\n- For registration see attached (signup.JPG)\n- For forgot password, see attached (forgot_password.JPG)\n\nAdditional info about username/email enumeration , i found it here: https://www.troyhunt.com/everything-you-ever-wanted-to-know/ under \"Username enumeration and the impact on anonymity\"",
